// The six-element wheel and the fusion recipes. Loaded by `hex_assets::elements`.
//
// Element ids are assigned from SORTED names, never file order (so reordering this
// file can never silently rewrite a stored lattice). The `wheel` order below is
// SEPARATE and defines only opposition: each element opposes the one len/2 (== 3)
// steps along — Light/Metal, Air/Earth, Fire/Water (docs/design/game.md).
//
// Higher-order elements are fusion outputs and are never on the wheel. Every recipe
// must be acyclic and every input must be a basic element or another fusion's output
// (validated at load). Content here is provisional — the roster is the design owner's
// to expand.
(
    wheel: ["Light", "Air", "Fire", "Metal", "Earth", "Water"],
    fusions: {
        // Lightning is the design's canonical fusion: an adjacent Light gem and an
        // adjacent Fire gem (docs/design/game.md, "Fusions").
        "Lightning": [
            (element: "Light", mana: 1),
            (element: "Fire", mana: 1),
        ],
    },
)
